.TXT 3 1 1 0
Cg a72.625000,73.000000,329
{\rtf1\ansi \deff0
{\fonttbl
{\f0\fnil Arial;}
{\f1\fnil Symbol;}
}
{\plain {\b Project 3.2}{  The linear FIR
 filters on Project 2.2 can be reconsidered
 now that we have the concept of an N-periodic
 frequency response, N-FR. We can efficiently
 calculate the N-PR with the DFT/FFT. Thus,
 we can compile the same information about
 the filters, and simulate them, in a more
 orderly and efficient manner.}}
}
